  "refugees": {
   "speaker": "quill",
   "text": "And the ones your craft can't hold. We'll take them aboard our ships. Haldis will treat them better than the Concord treated ours. On my lantern.",
   "next": "peace",
   "effects": [
    {
     "set_flag": "lantern_rescues",
     "value": true
    }
   ]
  },
  "refugees_ward": {
   "speaker": "quill",
   "text": "There's a sealed ward on your medical deck. We'll open it. They'll come to Haldis with us. On my lantern.",
   "next": "peace",
   "effects": [
    {
     "set_flag": "lantern_rescues",
     "value": true
    }
   ]
  },
  "w_purged": {
   "speaker": "quill",
   "text": "Gone. Three thousand lights, and you put them out so no one could have them. Do you know what you've done?",
   "choices": [
    {
     "text": "It was that, or let the Lattice use them again. I chose the fire.",
     "next": "p_ok",
     "tag": "Persuasion",
     "check": {
      "skill": "persuasion",
      "dc": 17,
      "id": "quill_purged",
      "bonus_if": [
       {
        "if": [
         {
          "flag": "senna_message"
         }
        ],
        "bonus": 3
       }
      ]
     },
     "success": "p_ok",
     "failure": "fight"
    },
    {
     "text": "Yes. And I'd do it again.",
     "next": "fight",
     "tone": "hard"
    },
    {
     "text": "Tav-7, the apron shield. Now.",
     "next": "tech",
     "tag": "Tav-7 – Computer Use",
     "if": [
      {
       "in_party": "tav7"
      }
     ],
     "check": {
      "skill": "computer_use",
      "dc": 14,
      "id": "quill_tech_p",
      "who": "tav7"
     },
     "success": "tech",
     "failure": "fight"
    }
   ]
  },
  "p_ok": {
   "speaker": "quill",
   "text": "The fire. ...We have a word for that too, on Haldis. Go. I can't look at you.",
   "next": "peace"
  },
  "w_loaded": {
   "speaker": "quill",
   "text": "Then you are carrying our grandmothers into a Concord courtroom to be exhibits. Unload the core and go in peace, or don't, and we burn the Petrel where it sits.",
